 "limitations": "Singleaffinecannotmodelparallax/nonrigidmotion/rollingreadout. Previewquantization/noiseaffectsfeaturepositions. MotionfitnotguaranteealignedcleantruthorvalidphysicalPTC. Inlierselectionnotnoisepixelselection. No production."
